# Local development overrides ONLY (.dev.vars is git-ignored; never commit
# real values). Copy to `.dev.vars` for local runs.
# DEV_FIXTURES=enabled makes the public API include the clearly-labelled
# development fixtures from fixtures/dev-catalog.sql. It is NEVER set in
# the production configuration, so fixtures cannot appear in production.
DEV_FIXTURES=disabled
# Cloudflare Access verification (Stage 03.2). In production these are
# set as Worker vars/secrets by the owner from the Access application:
# the team issuer and the application audience tag. Without them the
# admin API fails closed (401 for every request).
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=https://your-team.cloudflareaccess.com
# ACCESS_AUD=your-access-application-audience-tag
